  "grammar": {
    "title": "bghit ___ — ordering",
    "body": "**bghit** ('I want') + what you want is how you order: *bghit atay* (I want tea), *bghit tajine dyal djaj* (I want a chicken tajine).\nTwo Morocco-specific must-knows: mint tea is served **very sweet** by default — say **bla sukkar** (no sugar) or **shwiya dyal sukkar** (a little). And food is halal by default; for vegetarian, **bla l7am** (without meat) or **makanakolsh l7am** (I don't eat meat)."
  },
  "canDo": [
    "Order tea, coffee, and a meal",
    "Ask for no sugar / no meat and flag an allergy",
    "Understand what the waiter asks you, and ask for the bill"
  ],
